node_modules/


# dist/ is COMMITTED on purpose — see README. This package is consumed as a git
# dependency by two repos and a Netlify build, and a git dependency that has to
# compile itself on install is at the mercy of whichever package manager the
# consumer uses. npm runs `prepare`; bun, which builds the web app on Netlify,
# is not guaranteed to. The failure is a production build that cannot resolve
# any subpath, which is a bad way to find out.
